2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/VET_x2e__x2d_4_x2c_11_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/VIKR_x2e__x2d_86_x2c_14_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/_xc5__x9a_AT_x2e__x2d_BR_x2e__x2d_1_x2c_8_x2c_3_x2c_6_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/_xc5__x9a__xc4__x80_K_x2e__x2d_100_x2c_21>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/_xe1__xb9__x9a_V_x2e__x2d_10_x2c_65_x2c_7_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/_xe1__xb9__x9a_V_x2e__x2d_10_x2c__x2d_71_x2c_11_x2e_>, <https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/citation/_xe1__xb9__x9a_V_x2e__x2d_2_x2c_13_x2c_4_x2e_> ;
