<https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/sense/entry/As/tr/_x5f_as_x7e__x7e_h1_x5f_06_x5f_upa/13> a ontolex:LexicalSense ;
  skos:definition "<div n=\"1\">— 13) считать так <ab>v. a.</ab>, полагать таковым, признавать таковым: {#kaM te jye\\zWamupA^sate#}\n<ls>AV. 11,8,5.</ls> {#va\\SAM mf\\tyumupA^sate#}\n<ls n=\"AV.\">10,10,26.</ls> <ls>VS. 32,14</ls> (<ab>vgl.</ab> этим\n<ls>AV. 6,108,4</ls>, где {#viduH#} равнозначно {#upAsate#}). {#tadetadamftamityevAmutropAsItAyuritIha, prARa iti hEka upAsate prARo 'gniH prARo 'mftamiti vadantaH#}\n<ls>ŚAT. BR. 10,2,6,19.</ls> <ls n=\"ŚAT. BR. 10,\">3,4,5.</ls> {#vAyuragniriti ha SAkAyanina upAsate#} так полагают\n<ls>Ś. 4,5,1. 5,2,20.</ls> {#satyaM brahmetyupAsIta#}\n<ls n=\"Ś.\">6,3,1. 2. 11,4,4,9 — 12. 12,2,3,3. 14,4,2,22. 5,1,2</ls> (= <ls>BṚH. ĀR. UP. 1,4,10. 2,1,2).</ls> {#iti prAcInayogyopAsva#} так считай это\n<ls>TAITT. UP. 1,6,2.</ls>"@ru ;
  pwglex:sourceGloss "<div n=\"1\">— 13) {%achten%} so <ab>v. a.</ab> {%dafür halten, dafür erkennen%}: {#kaM te jye\\zWamupA^sate#}\n<ls>AV. 11,8,5.</ls> {#va\\SAM mf\\tyumupA^sate#}\n<ls n=\"AV.\">10,10,26.</ls> <ls>VS. 32,14</ls> (<ab>vgl.</ab> damit\n<ls>AV. 6,108,4</ls>, wo {#viduH#} dem {#upAsate#} gleichsteht). {#tadetadamftamityevAmutropAsItAyuritIha, prARa iti hEka upAsate prARo 'gniH prARo 'mftamiti vadantaH#}\n<ls>ŚAT. BR. 10,2,6,19.</ls> <ls n=\"ŚAT. BR. 10,\">3,4,5.</ls> {#vAyuragniriti ha SAkAyanina upAsate#} {%so meinen die%}\n<ls>Ś. 4,5,1. 5,2,20.</ls> {#satyaM brahmetyupAsIta#}\n<ls n=\"Ś.\">6,3,1. 2. 11,4,4,9 — 12. 12,2,3,3. 14,4,2,22. 5,1,2</ls> (= <ls>BṚH. ĀR. UP. 1,4,10. 2,1,2).</ls> {#iti prAcInayogyopAsva#} {%so betrachte es%}\n<ls>TAITT. UP. 1,6,2.</ls>"@de ;
